# Supersonic compressible Taylor-Green vortex from Chapelier et al. (Phys. Fluids 2024)
# Periodic box [-pi,pi]^3, uniform mesh (no AMR)
Base nx: 32
Base ny: 32
Base nz: 32
Max level: 0
Max grid size: 16

# Flow definition
Gamma:    1.4
Mach:     1.25
Reynolds: 1600
Prandtl:  0.71
Bulk to shear ratio: 0.0

# Do we use SGS modeling (both off, as the reference); the coefficient applies to bSGS only
Use bSGS model: .true.
Use sSGS model: .false.

# Time integration: iterative midpoint, explicit, so Max CFL bounds the acoustic CFL (|u|+c)*dt/dx of each direction
Max dt:   5e-2
Max CFL:  0.5
Max time: 20
Subiterations: 3

# Output
Output period: 1.0
